<title>FRANCE: France to offer 17 bln Ffr of T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>France to offer 17 bln Ffr of T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said it would offer 17 billion francs of bills at its next weekly tender on Monday, September 16.</p>
<p>The offering will comprise 12 billion francs of 13-week bills and five billion francs of 50-week paper.</p>
<p>Payment for the 13-week paper is due on September 19. Payment for the 50-week bills is due on September 26.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
